LinuxKernelForTB323FU
Copyright (C) 2026 GredisEmber and contributors

Personal build metadata and prebuilt kernel for the Lenovo Legion Tab Gen 5 /
Legion Y700 5th Gen (TB323FU). This is an independent community build, not an
official release of tb323fu-linux and not affiliated with Lenovo, Qualcomm or
Valve. Those names identify the device and software only.


Upstream project
----------------

tb323fu-linux
Copyright (C) 2026 Joonhoe Kim and contributors
https://github.com/joonhoekim/tb323fu-linux

The kernel patch series, board configuration, initramfs init, gpu-probe and
aw882xx integration originate there. The imported version is tag kernel-t65,
commit 38f6c9adff49f6a1947142657af013c1090f9a9c. Imported patches retain
their original authors, copyright lines and Signed-off-by trailers.


