Source availability
-------------------

SOURCE.md gives the exact Linux base commit and tarball checksum, patch order,
local modifications and build environment. BUILD.md and scripts/build.sh
describe and automate reconstruction of the corresponding kernel source and
Image. Imported helpers without source in this checkout are identified by their
upstream repository path and commit.
